

Fact asset Identified by A1, A2, A3

Fact permission Identified by actor * asset
  Derived from permission(actor, asset) When Not(prohibited(actor, asset))

Fact prohibited Identified by actor * asset.

Extend Fact actor Identified by Eve, John.

?permission(actor=Eve).
?permission(actor=John).

+prohibited(Eve, A1).

?!permission(Eve, A1).
?permission(actor=John).

+prohibited.

?!permission(actor=Eve).
?!permission(actor=John).
